<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.TeleportAgent(AvatarID: uuid, LandmarkName: string, Position: vector, LookAtPoint: vector)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llTeleportAgent(key AvatarID, string LandmarkName, vector Position, vector LookAtPoint);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Teleports an <b>agent</b> to a <b>landmark</b> stored in the object&#39;s inventory.</p>
  <p>If <b>landmark</b> is an empty string, the avatar is teleported to the location <b>position</b> in the current region.</p>
  <p>If the destination is in the current region, the avatar will land facing <b>look_at</b> as a position within that region. Otherwise, <b>look_at</b> is treated as a unit direction.</p>
</p>
